@Learn.Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5280

### Serve the site root (mapped to index.html)
GET {{Learn.Web_HostAddress}}/
Accept: text/html

### Serve a nested default document (foo/ -> foo/index.html)
GET {{Learn.Web_HostAddress}}/03.01-authentication/
Accept: text/html

### Serve a specific static asset
GET {{Learn.Web_HostAddress}}/styles.css
Accept: text/css

### Invalidate a single cached path
POST {{Learn.Web_HostAddress}}/_cache/invalidate?path=/index.html
X-Invalidate-Key: change-me

### Flush the entire cache
POST {{Learn.Web_HostAddress}}/_cache/invalidate
X-Invalidate-Key: change-me
